<DTA TYPE="STRING">RT for over<MET> 50 mm</MET><ENG> 2 inches</ENG> NPS with thickness over<MET> 20 mm</MET><ENG> 3/4 inch</ENG>. Visual for all sizes with thickness<MET> 20 mm</MET><ENG> 3/4 inch</ENG> or less.</DTA>
