<DTA TYPE="STRING">(7) In lieu of radiography of welded branch connections when required above, liquid penetrant or magnetic particle examination is acceptable and, when used, must be performed at the lesser of one half of the weld thickness or each<MET> 13 mm</MET><ENG> 1/2 inch</ENG> of weld thickness and all accessible final weld surfaces.</DTA>
         </CEL>
      </ROW>
      <ROW AUTOHEIGHT="0" HEIGHT="36.00">
