<DTA TYPE="STRING">(9) Fillet welds not exceeding<MET> 6 mm</MET><ENG> 1/4 inch</ENG> throat thickness which are used for the permanent attachment of nonpressure retaining parts are exempt from the PT or MT requirements of the above table.</DTA>
         </CEL>
